# migrated from tests/cases/contractions.chat (gen346)
#
# ⚠ gen491, regola R1 (TEST_TODO §0.0): questo file girava in contesto ERMETICO
# — `PARROT0_BASE=` vuota e `WORLD_FACTS=0`, cioe' una KB di sole regole senza
# conoscenza. Non si fa piu': la KB non e' un volume montato sotto parrot0, e'
# parrot0, e spegnerla non misura parrot0 con meno rumore — misura un altro
# sistema. Qui si testa con la KB al massimo, e le attese sono quelle vere.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test contractions]
# gen74: chat contraction canonicalization. Common abbreviated forms
# are expanded to canonical spaced forms so existing parsers work.
# "sup" added to social.p0 as an opening marker.
> sup
< Hi there!
> whats 2 plus 2
< 4.
> what's 2 plus 2
< 4.
> whos a dog
< I don't know about dog.
> dont say that
< I don't understand that yet.
> whats parrot0
< parrot0 is parrot0.
# broader wellbeing patterns from social.p0
> how is your day going
< I'm well, thanks. How can I help?
> hows your day
< I'm well, thanks. How can I help?

